 "brief_summary": "The purpose of this study, performed under the master protocol W8M-MC- CWMM (NCT06143956), is to evaluate the efficacy and safety of LY4086940 compared with placebo in participants without type 2 diabetes who have obesity or who have overweight with a weight-related health condition.\n\nParticipation in the study will last about 58 weeks.",
 "eligibility": {
  "criteria": "Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Meet inclusion criteria under Master Protocol CWMM (NCT06143956)\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\nIn addition to exclusion criteria under Master Protocol CWMM (NCT06143956)\n\n* Have any prior diagnosis of type 2 diabetes, type 1 diabetes, or rare forms of diabetes mellitus, except gestational diabetes\n* Have a laboratory value suggestive of diabetes\n* Have any of the following cardiovascular conditions within 6 months prior to screening:\n\n  * acute myocardial infarction\n  * cerebrovascular accident (stroke)\n  * unstable angina, or\n  * hospitalization due to congestive heart failure\n* Have a known personal or family history (first-degree relative) of multiple endocrine neoplasia type 2A or 2B, thyroid C-cell hyperplasia, or medullary thyroid carcinoma.\n* Within 6 months prior to screening, have taken medications (prescribed or over the counter) or alternative remedies (including herbal or nutritional supplements) that promote weight loss",
  "sex": "ALL",
  "minimum_age": "18 Years",
  "maximum_age": "75 Years",
